    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;10.XXX</strong> Proposed risk stratification model for uterine inflammatory myofibroblastic tumours</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Jennifer A. Bennett",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 33.32%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">0 points</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 33.32%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">1&ndash;2 points*</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 33.32%; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">3&ndash;4 points</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 33.32%; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Low-risk</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 33.32%; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Intermediate-risk</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 33.32%; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"33%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">High-risk</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">1&nbsp;point each assigned for each of the following: age &gt;&nbsp;45&nbsp;years, size &gt; 50&nbsp;mm, &gt;&nbsp;4&nbsp;mitoses per 2.5&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup>, infiltrative borders</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">*Next-generation sequencing has been recommended to further stratify tumours. See text for additional details regarding risk stratification.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Adapted from <span class=\"Ref-PMID\"><span style=\"mso-no-proof: no;\">{36344483}</span></span></p>",
